---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const pageTitle = 'Terms of Use & Disclaimer | AllFinConverter';
const pageDescription =
  'Terms of Use and Disclaimer for AllFinConverter: informational conversion tool nature, reference rates, liability limitations, and acceptable use.';
---

<BaseLayout
  title={pageTitle}
  description={pageDescription}
>
  <main class="page-main">
    <div class="content-container">
      <header class="info-header">
        <h1 class="info-title">Terms of Use &amp; Disclaimer</h1>
        <p class="info-subtitle">
          Last updated: 8 November 2026 &bull; Clear, transparent terms governing the use of AllFinConverter.
        </p>
      </header>

      <article class="info-card">
        <section class="info-section">
          <h2 class="info-section-title">1. Acceptance and Scope</h2>
          <p class="info-text">
            By accessing, browsing, or using AllFinConverter (<a href="https://allfinconverter.com">allfinconverter.com</a>), you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to be bound by these Terms of Use &amp; Disclaimer (&ldquo;Terms&rdquo;). If you do not agree to these Terms, you should discontinue using the website.
          </p>
          <p class="info-text">
            Your use of the website is subject to applicable mandatory legal rights and statutory consumer protections that cannot be excluded under your local jurisdiction.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="info-section">
          <h2 class="info-section-title">2. Nature of the Service</h2>
          <p class="info-text">
            AllFinConverter is an informational, client-side reference utility for converting between fiat currencies, cryptocurrencies, and precious metals. AllFinConverter:
          </p>
          <ul class="info-list">
            <li>Is <strong>not</strong> a bank, financial institution, broker-dealer, money services business, currency exchange, investment platform, or payment service provider.</li>
            <li>Does <strong>not</strong> execute trades, buy, sell, or exchange assets of any kind.</li>
            <li>Does <strong>not</strong> transfer funds, handle money, process financial transactions, hold deposits, or provide custody or wallet services.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="info-section">
          <h2 class="info-section-title">3. Indicative Rates and Information</h2>
          <p class="info-text">
            All exchange rates, market quotes, and conversion figures presented on AllFinConverter are reference values obtained from external third-party data providers. You understand and agree that:
          </p>
          <ul class="info-list">
            <li>Rates may be delayed, incomplete, temporarily unavailable, or inaccurate.</li>
            <li>Market rates fluctuate constantly, and reference rates may differ substantially from executable prices offered in real time by commercial banks, foreign exchange kiosks, card networks, brokers, or digital asset exchanges.</li>
            <li>All conversion calculations are mathematical estimates for general reference only and must never be interpreted or represented as guaranteed transaction prices, binding commercial quotes, or offers to transact.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="info-section">
          <h2 class="info-section-title">4. Calculation Methodology and Accuracy</h2>
          <p class="info-text">
            Conversions are calculated mathematically in your web browser using our Canonical USD Base Bridge and arbitrary-precision arithmetic (<a href="https://github.com/MikeMcl/big.js" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Big.js</a>) applied to available rate snapshots.
          </p>
          <p class="info-text">
            While reasonable care is taken in assembling and validating reference data, AllFinConverter makes no express or implied warranty or representation that every calculation, dataset, or page will always be error-free, complete, uninterrupted, or available at any given time.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="info-section">
          <h2 class="info-section-title">5. No Financial, Investment, Tax, or Legal Advice</h2>
          <p class="info-text">
            The content, calculations, and data made available on AllFinConverter are provided solely for general informational and educational purposes.
          </p>
          <p class="info-text">
            Nothing contained on this website constitutes, or should be construed as, financial, investment, trading, hedging, tax, accounting, or legal advice. AllFinConverter does not recommend or endorse the purchase, sale, holding, or trading of any currency, cryptocurrency, or commodity. Visitors should seek independent professional advice tailored to their specific circumstances from qualified financial, tax, or legal advisors where appropriate.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="info-section">
          <h2 class="info-section-title">6. Independent Verification Required</h2>
          <p class="info-text">
            You are solely responsible for evaluating the merits and risks associated with using any financial information. Before executing any conversion, financial transaction, cross-border remittance, commercial purchase, or investment decision, you must independently verify prevailing exchange rates, spreads, retail commissions, transaction fees, and terms directly with your bank, broker, exchange, or financial service provider.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="info-section">
          <h2 class="info-section-title">7. Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <p class="info-text">
            To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, AllFinConverter, its maintainers, and contributors shall not be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, special, consequential, exemplary, or punitive damages, or for any loss of profits, revenue, data, business opportunities, or anticipated savings, arising out of or in connection with:
          </p>
          <ul class="info-list">
            <li>Your access to, use of, or inability to access or use the website or its conversion tools.</li>
            <li>Reliance placed upon any displayed exchange rates, conversion calculations, or reference data.</li>
            <li>Errors, omissions, delays, defects, or inaccuracies in market data or rate feeds.</li>
            <li>Failures, downtime, interruptions, or decommissioning of third-party rate providers or infrastructure.</li>
            <li>Website outages, transmission failures, or technical calculation discrepancies.</li>
            <li>Any financial, investment, commercial, or personal decisions made using information displayed on the website.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="info-text" style="font-weight: 600; padding: 0.875rem 1rem; background-color: var(--color-unit-bg); border-left: 3px solid var(--color-brand-primary); border-radius: 4px;">
            Statutory Savings Clause: Nothing in these Terms excludes, restricts or modifies any right, guarantee, warranty or liability that cannot lawfully be excluded, restricted or modified under applicable law.
          </p>
          <p class="info-text">
            Because certain jurisdictions do not permit the exclusion of certain warranties or the limitation of liability for consequential or incidental damages, some of the above limitations may not apply to you in full. In such jurisdictions, our liability shall be limited to the greatest extent permissible by the governing law.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="info-section">
          <h2 class="info-section-title">8. Third-Party Data and Services</h2>
          <p class="info-text">
            AllFinConverter references market data published by third-party providers, including the European Central Bank (via Frankfurter), CoinMarketCap, and Gold-API.
          </p>
          <p class="info-text">
            AllFinConverter does not own, control, or operate these external services. We do not guarantee the continued availability, timeliness, accuracy, or completeness of third-party feeds, and we reserve the right to modify, replace, or remove data providers at any time without notice.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="info-section">
          <h2 class="info-section-title">9. External Links</h2>
          <p class="info-text">
            This website may contain hyperlinks to external third-party websites, resources, or documentation. These links are provided solely as a convenience to visitors. AllFinConverter does not endorse, control, monitor, or accept responsibility for the content, privacy policies, products, or services of any linked third-party websites.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="info-section">
          <h2 class="info-section-title">10. Acceptable Use</h2>
          <p class="info-text">
            You agree to use AllFinConverter solely for lawful purposes. You agree not to:
          </p>
          <ul class="info-list">
            <li>Engage in any activity that disrupts, degrades, overburdens, or impairs the functionality, security, or availability of the website or its servers.</li>
            <li>Attempt to gain unauthorized access to any system, server, network, or restricted data associated with the website.</li>
            <li>Introduce malicious software, viruses, worms, Trojan horses, or harmful code.</li>
            <li>Engage in abusive automated scraping, denial-of-service attempts, or data extraction that imposes unreasonable load on website infrastructure.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="info-text">
            Nothing in these Terms prohibits or restricts ordinary, reasonable personal use of the website through standard web browsing.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="info-section">
          <h2 class="info-section-title">11. Intellectual Property</h2>
          <p class="info-text">
            All original website design, branding, layout, source code, logos, and written text are protected by copyright, trademark, and other applicable intellectual property laws. All rights not expressly granted are reserved.
          </p>
          <p class="info-text">
            All product names, trademarks, registered trademarks, and data feeds referenced on the website are the property of their respective owners and are used for identification and informational attribution purposes only.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="info-section">
          <h2 class="info-section-title">12. Service Availability and Modifications</h2>
          <p class="info-text">
            AllFinConverter is provided on an &ldquo;as is&rdquo; and &ldquo;as available&rdquo; basis. We reserve the right to modify, suspend, update, or discontinue any feature, asset pair, conversion calculation, rate provider, or portion of the service at any time without prior notice or liability.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="info-section">
          <h2 class="info-section-title">13. Applicable Law and Mandatory Consumer Rights</h2>
          <p class="info-text">
            AllFinConverter serves an international audience. Because visitors access this website from diverse legal jurisdictions around the world, mandatory consumer protection laws, statutory warranties, and local rights applicable in your jurisdiction remain unaffected by these Terms.
          </p>
          <p class="info-text">
            If any provision of these Terms is determined by a court of competent jurisdiction to be invalid, unlawful, or unenforceable, that provision shall be severed to the minimum extent necessary, and the remaining provisions shall remain in full force and effect. Formal governing-law and dispute-resolution provisions are subject to professional legal review and determination as the project evolves.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="info-section">
          <h2 class="info-section-title">14. Contact</h2>
          <p class="info-text">
            If you have questions, feedback, or legal inquiries regarding these Terms of Use &amp; Disclaimer, please contact us by email:
          </p>
          <p class="info-text">
            <a href="mailto:support@allfinconverter.com">support@allfinconverter.com</a>
          </p>
        </section>
      </article>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
